sequenceDiagram
    actor F as Freelancer
    participant API as Backend
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant S as Stripe
    F->>API: Withdraw amount (Stripe method)
    API->>DB: Amount at least the minimum? Wallet covers it?
    API->>DB: Stripe account onboarding complete?
    API->>DB: Atomic debit reserves the funds first
    API->>S: Create the payout
    alt Payout accepted
        S-->>API: Payout reference
        API->>DB: Withdrawal recorded (processing or completed)
        API-->>F: Withdrawal started
    else Stripe fails
        S-->>API: Error
        API->>DB: Refund the reservation to the wallet
        API-->>F: Friendly error, no money lost
    end
